      en: ["The Medina of Sousse was listed as a UNESCO World Heritage site in 1988.", "The Ribat of Sousse was completed in 821 AD and is exceptionally preserved.", "The city's ramparts stretch for a total length of 2,250 meters.", "The Great Mosque of Sousse does not have a minaret, appearing fort-like.", "The Khalaf al-Fata tower in the Kasbah was constructed in 859 AD.", "Sousse served as the most important naval port for the Aghlabids."],
      es: ["Patrimonio de la Humanidad desde: 1988", "Construida en el siglo IX", "Longitud de la muralla: 2,5 km", "Superficie: 32 hectáreas", "Gran Mezquita construida: 851 d.C.", "Altura del Ribat: 15 metros"],
