      en: ["Attained the status of municipium in the 2nd century", "Triumphal arch of Septimius Severus built in 211 AD", "Features temples dedicated to Apollo, Ceres, and Pluto", "Strategically located on the Carthage-Theveste road", "Served as a Christian bishopric seat in late antiquity", "Byzantine fortification ruins date to the 6th century"],
