      en: ["Originally built between 916 and 921 AD", "The vaulted corridor is over 50 meters long", "Once part of the Fatimid capital's defensive walls", "Rebuilt after Spanish destruction in 1554", "The only major remaining element of the land ramparts", "Currently serves as the main entrance to the historic medina"],
